## Cloudflare-Compatible Package Alternatives

| Instead of | Use | Reason |
|-----------|-----|--------|
| `bcrypt` | `bcryptjs` or Web Crypto PBKDF2 | No native binaries |
| `sharp` | Cloudflare Images / Workers AI | No native binaries |
| `jsonwebtoken` | `jose` | Web Crypto based |
| `uuid` | `crypto.randomUUID()` | Built-in to Workers runtime |
| `axios` | `fetch` (native) | Built-in, zero bundle cost |
| `node-fetch` | `fetch` (native) | Built-in globally |
| `prisma` | `drizzle-orm` | Lighter bundle, native D1 support |
| `fs` (persistence) | R2 or KV | No real filesystem in Workers |
| `redis` | KV or Durable Objects | Native Cloudflare alternatives |
| `bull/bullmq` | Cloudflare Queues | Native serverless queues |
| `socket.io` | Durable Objects WebSocket | Native WebSocket support |
